The files in patches/ are modifications of DeepSeek Harness (DSH), published on
npm as @deepseek-ai/* (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). Each
patch contains excerpts of the original DSH source (context and removed lines)
together with changes made by the contributors of this project. The patches
were made against @deepseek-ai/dsh 0.1.6-alpha.1. The test and tool scripts load
and exercise DSH code from a local installation but do not contain it, except
where a comment quotes a short fragment for explanation.

